usda.db: energy values from USDA FoodData Central
==================================================

usda.db holds a hand-curated subset (about 500 common ingredients) of the
energy values, in kcal per 100 g, from two USDA FoodData Central (FDC)
datasets:

- Foundation Foods, April 2026 release
  (FoodData_Central_foundation_food_csv_2026-04-30.zip)
- SR Legacy, April 2018 release
  (FoodData_Central_sr_legacy_food_csv_2018-04.zip)

Source: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets

Each row keeps its FDC id. Energy is nutrient 1008 (Energy, kcal) where the
food has it; Foundation foods without it use 2048 (Atwater Specific Factors),
then 2047 (Atwater General Factors). The ingredient names and aliases are
RecipeCraft's own; tools/nutrition/aliases.csv lists every mapping and
tools/nutrition/build_usda.py rebuilds the file.

